==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Desert Voe Trousers are a piece of [[Attire]] that only [[Link]] can wear, and are obtained by completing the [[Quest]] "[[Colorful Kara Kara Bazaar]]". They can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], and are made by the [[Gerudo]] with [[Sapphire]]s to lower the effects of intense heat.<ref name="AoC Allies"/> Although, wearing them in battle does not benefit Link in any way.

